{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55001","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城（京本作「军」）营内，昼夜起虚惊。\n营所田（辛本、川本、京本作「旧」）爲神庙地，速移营寨莫居停（京本作「速将移徙莫教停」），不去贼偷营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}